{:edb/db-before-t 2683 :edb/db-after-t 2684 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535996 50 #inst "2026-10-15T16:54:02.406Z" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186554750 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186554758 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186554759 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186554766 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186083278 1038 #edb/ref 17592186554769 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186083278 1040 #edb/ref 17592186554775 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554750 1068 #edb/ref 17592186554765 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554750 1068 #edb/ref 17592186554771 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554750 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554750 1071 "A curve is defined by the parametric equations\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{1}{3}{t}^{3}-{t}^{2}-8t,\\,y=-{t}^{3}-6{t}^{2}-9t,\\,-\\infty<t<\\infty.\n$$\n\nDetermine the values of $t$ at which the tangent to the curve is horizontal. Give exact answers.\n\nIn **ascending order**, the tangent to the curve is horizontal at $t=$\n{{field-1}}\nand $t=$\n{{field-2}}." 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554750 1072 #uuid "014ba384-9efa-58d4-8e01-62ced760018d" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554750 1074 "The slope $m$ of a tangent line to a curve defined parametrically is given by\n\n$$\nm=\\frac{y'(t)}{x'(t)}.\n$$\n\nThe tangent line is horizontal if $y'(t)=0$ while $x'(t)\\ne 0.$\n\nSo, we first find the derivatives of $x$ and $y:$\n\n$$\nx'(t)={t}^{2}-2t-8,\\qquad y'(t)=-3{t}^{2}-12t-9.\n$$\n\nSolving $y'(t)=0$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{t}^{2}-12t-9 & =0 \\\\ -3(t+1)(t+3) & =0 \\\\ t & =-3,-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we note that\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x'(-3) & =7\\ne 0, \\\\ x'(-1) & =-5\\ne 0,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich confirms that the tangent to the curve is indeed horizontal at $t=-3$ and $t=-1$." 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554751 1080 "-3" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554751 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554751 1083 #uuid "01e8aae2-003e-59d4-9f51-6280d59e1f6d" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554752 1080 "2" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554752 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554752 1083 #uuid "101c6d23-9011-58fd-9edb-d075ec501e2e" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554753 1080 "4" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554753 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554753 1083 #uuid "2e3aefa0-3c97-5c28-89c2-9c4da8965c43" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554754 1075 #edb/ref 17592186554753 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554754 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554754 1077 "field-2" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554754 1078 #edb/ref 17592186554753 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554754 1079 #uuid "3239d979-9412-599c-bf13-cf6040c94d87" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554755 1075 #edb/ref 17592186554764 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554755 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045492 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554755 1077 "field-1" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554755 1078 #edb/ref 17592186554764 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554755 1079 #uuid "385dd9b4-d451-5634-82e9-e816876b5027" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554756 1080 "2" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554756 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554756 1083 #uuid "449eb05f-0eb9-526c-953c-ff1dcf5569bf" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554757 1080 "-1" 13194139535996 17592186045443 true] [17592186554757 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535996 1759218604